.TH SHUTDOWN 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
shutdown \- disable socket communication
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/socket.h>
.B int shutdown(int descriptor, int how);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Disables reception with SHUT_RD, transmission with SHUT_WR, or both with
SHUT_RDWR on the socket. It does not close the descriptor.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shutdown (2)
